# 1. Project objective

Build an end-to-end predictive maintenance system that estimates the probability of machine failure using machine operating conditions.

The system should:

- Predict the probability of machine failure.
- Classify machines as lower risk or higher risk using a configurable decision threshold.
- Identify which operating conditions contribute most to the prediction.
- Compare several ML algorithms and select a defensible final model.
- Detect and minimize overfitting and data leakage.
- Support single-machine predictions and batch predictions from CSV files.
- Provide a clean, interactive Streamlit web application.
- Be ready to deploy to a cloud platform such as Streamlit Community Cloud.
- Include reproducible training, evaluation, testing, documentation, and setup instructions.

Use the project name **MachineGuard AI** consistently throughout the application and documentation.

